loopcatcher (0.1.5-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First release as loopcatcher.
  * Generic loopback audio capture positioning and documentation.
  * Keep sink default name as "spotify" for compatibility.
  * Interactive TUI with runtime config menu and session output handling.
  * Debian packaging metadata and desktop integration.
  * Relicense the project under the MIT (Expat) License.

